#ROOMS

#78000
"Before a Large Encampment"
"Stretching out before you to the east a large encampment surrounded by a
mixture of piled up dirt mounds and crude cobblestone walls.  Peeking up
from behind the mounds you can see several canvas tents flying black
banners.  The sound of metal clanging and wagon wheels rolling across
gravel can be heard from within the encampment.  Every few moments you
can hear a loud 'WHOOSH' sound come from within the camp as something
large flies overhead.  To the west a small path leads out into the grassy
wilds of Shadybrook.
"
""
301465601 0
3 5 0
D1
""
""
0 -1 78001 0 5
-1
S

#78001
"Along a Dirt Path"
"Large mounds of dirt have been built up along each side of the path,
obscuring what lies behind them.  Bits of dark grey gravel litter the
path and fill in the deep wagon ruts which scar its surface.  Peering off
to the east you can see several more built-up mounds of dirt and tucked
in between each is a large catapault.  A wide moat filled with a thick,
black liquid has been dug to the north and south of the path and
continues around the front of the encampment.  The path continues to the
east where it edges deeper into the heart of the encampment while to the
west it heads out and away from it.
"
""
