#78010
"Battery 'B' - Along a Row of Catapaults"
"Lining the edges of this small footpath are several dirt barricades
behind which you can see large siege catapaults.  Broken arrow shafts,
cracked blocks of stone and pieces of punctured plate armor lie scattered
about the path.  Lying in the center of the footpath is the decaying
corpse of a goblin infantryman; stripped of all armor and left for the
grue.  To the north and south the footpath continues along the row of
catapaults.
"
""
