#78011
"Catapault Emplacement"
"Built up to the north and south is a high wall of dirt with chunks of
stone thrown in for extra reinforcement.  Resting directly in the center
of the barricade is a heavy siege catapault poised to fire.  Beside the
catapault are several large stones the size of an ogre's head.  The
western face of the barricade has been cleared away leaving only about
three feet of dirt as protection.  To the east a small gap in the
barricade leads out of the catapault emplacement.
"
""
