#78012
"Battery 'B' - Along a Row of Catapaults"
"The smell of decaying flesh, rotten meat, and unwashed bodies fills the
air.  The dark grey gravel which has been scattered about the footpath is
covered in dried blood stains as well as bits of decaying flesh. 
Bloodied and rusty spears and pikes have been carelessly tossed about the
path in a unorganized fashion.  Directly to the west a small gap in the
barricade wall leads into a catapault emplacement.  The footpath
continues its north-south course through the lines of catapaults.
"
""
