#78013
"Catapault Emplacement"
"A large heavy siege catapault with four wheels has been placed in the
center of this barricade; aimed toward the west and ready to fire. 
Scattered around the catapault are several large blocks of stone and
heavy wooden balls coated in a oily substance.  A small campfire has been
setup against the southern edge of the emplacement over which hangs a
small iron kettle.  A narrow opening in the mound of dirt to the east
offers the only exit out of the emplacement.
"
""
