#78015
"Battery 'B' - Catapault Emplacement"
"The shattered remains of large stone blocks lie scattered about the room. 
Large crates have been stacked up against the southern edge of the
emplacement each filled with various siege tools.  Positioned directly in
the center of the room is a large, heavy siege catapault aimed to the
west and ready to fire.  The western edge of the barricade has been
lowered to allow the catapaults a clear firing angle.  Protruding from
the top of the dirt mounds to the north, south and on the edges of the
western portion are large wooden spikes tipped with steel heads.  To the
east a small gap in the barricade leads out of the emplacement.
"
""
